@* A label instead of a glyph, which is what a toggle wants when the state is a word rather than
   a shape. aria-pressed is set either way — that is what makes it a toggle and not a checkbox. *@
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
    <Toggle Name="grid" Checked><Icon Name="layout-grid" />Grid</Toggle>
    <Toggle Name="compact">Compact</Toggle>
</div>
